(Thank you, Kinner. Good morning. Thank you for joining our call this morning to discuss our) Tj
T*
(first quarter 2021 results. Let me begin with some comments about the recent events. The) Tj
T*
(significant loss in our prime services business relating to the failure of a US-based hedge fund) Tj
T*
(is unacceptable. In combination with the recent issues around the supply chain finance funds, I) Tj
