(detail shortly. This will enable us to further strengthen our balance sheet and support the) Tj
T*
(momentum in our core franchises.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Credit Suisse remains a formidable institution with a rich history. We have thrived for more) Tj
T*
(than 160 years through external crises and our own challenges. I'm confident for the future. At) Tj
T*
(the heart of this confidence is the earnings power of Credit Suisse and the resilience and) Tj
T*
(dedication of our roughly 49,000 employees around the world. I would like to take this) Tj
T*
(opportunity to thank all our employees globally for their unwavering commitment to Credit Suisse) Tj
T*
(and to our clients, which they have been demonstrating not only over the past few years, but) Tj
T*
(particularly during the last few weeks, which were very challenging. They make me proud every) Tj
T*
(day.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(In testament to their perseverance and adaptability, our underlying first quarter financial) Tj
T*
(performance across all divisions was not only resilient, but also strong. It was supported by) Tj
